	"contributes.configuration.properties.git-graph.repository.commits.loadMoreAutomatically.description": "当视图滚动到底部时，自动加载更多提交（如果存在），无需按\"加载更多提交\"按钮。",
	"contributes.configuration.properties.git-graph.repository.commits.mute.commitsThatAreNotAncestorsOfHead.description": "以浅色文本显示不是已签出分支/提交祖先的提交。仅当显示所有分支时才会执行此操作。",
